abstract: >
  CmmDFT is a Python package implementing classical density functional
  theory (cDFT) for modeling gas adsorption and diffusion in nanoporous
  materials such as metal-organic frameworks (MOFs).
keywords:
  - classical density functional theory
  - metal-organic frameworks
  - adsorption
  - diffusion
  - molecular simulation
